<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '24px 64px 0' }}>
    {/* A 区 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 96, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'flex-start' }}>
     <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1423' }}>
 之方法：<span style={{ color: '#FA4F24' }}>技术治理三道门</span>，卡住选型也卡住引入
      </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#8A8F99', marginTop: 8 }}>
     技术风险不是审出来的，是提前拦下来的
    </Text>
    </Box>
 <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E8E8E8' }} />

    {/* B 区 */}
  <Box style={{ paddingTop: 24, paddingBottom: 14, height: 479, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
        {/* 左 三道门 */}
        <Box style={{ width: 500, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1423' }}>三道门，各管一件事</Text>
{[
   { g: 'T1 选型门', q: '为什么不复用现有组件', c: '#0F1423', tc: '#FFFFFF' },
     { g: 'T2 引入门', q: '这个组件谁维护、退出时间是什么', c: '#FA4F24', tc: '#FFFFFF' },
        { g: 'T3 上线门', q: '十二项部署就绪检查是否全过', c: '#F8622F', tc: '#FFFFFF' },
      ].map((it, i) => (
   <Box key={i} style={{ flex: 1, background: it.c, borderRadius: 4, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 18px', gap: 16 }}>
       <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: it.tc, width: 110 }}>{it.g}</Text>
 <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: it.tc, opacity: 0.92, flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>{it.q}</Text>
        {i < 2 && <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: it.tc, opacity: 0.6 }}>↓</Text>}
      </Box>
    ))}
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F7F8', borderRadius: 4, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', borderLeft: '4px solid #FA4F24' }}>
 <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C43A17' }}>门要有否决权，也要有登记</Text>
  <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#3A4050', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 3 }}>
   三道门都由架构委员会把守，且都可以否决。同时必须留一个「例外台账」：
    绕过门的申请登记，带到期日。否则门会被绕过，或者被当成洪水猛兽。
       </Text>
      </Box>
        </Box>

        {/* 右 例外台账 + 门后站谁 */}
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1423' }}>例外台账（示例）</Text>
   <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 4 }}>
   {['项目', '绕过了哪道门', '理由', '到期'].map((t, i) => (
     <Box key={i} style={{ flex: i === 1 ? 1.6 : 1, background: '#0F1423', padding: '7px 4px', alignItems: 'center', borderRadius: 2 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>{t}</Text>
   </Box>
     ))}
      </Box>
   {[
    { p: '海外支付网关', g: 'T1 选型门', r: '监管要求本地化', d: '2027-03' },
    { p: '实时风控引擎', g: 'T2 引入门', r: '自研无可替代', d: '2027-09' },
      { p: '老报表系统迁移', g: 'T3 上线门', r: '压测暂未通过', d: '2026-12' },
    ].map((it, i) => (
       <Box key={i} style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 4, alignItems: 'center' }}>
      {[{ v: it.p, f: 1.4 }, { v: it.g, f: 1.6 }, { v: it.r, f: 1.2 }, { v: it.d, f: 1 }].map((c, j) => (
     <Box key={j} style={{ flex: c.f, background: i === 2 ? '#FFF3EE' : (i % 2 === 0 ? '#F7F7F8' : '#FFFFFF'), borderRadius: 2, padding: '0 4px', alignItems: 'center', borderBottom: '1px solid #E8E8E8' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: j === 3 ? '#C43A17' : '#3A4050', fontWeight: j === 0 ? 'bold' : 'normal' }}>{c.v}</Text>
       </Box>
       ))}
    </Box>
      ))}
      <Box style={{ flex: 1.2, background: '#0F1423', borderRadius: 4, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FBA15C' }}>台账真正的价值</Text>
   <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.88)', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 4 }}>
   三个月后回看：哪道门被绕过最多，哪道门的标准就该改。
     例外不是违规记录，是标准进化的输入。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* C 区 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 58, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E8E8E8' }}>
  <Box style={{ width: 10, height: 10, background: '#FA4F24' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8A8F99', marginLeft: 12 }}>硕磐机密 · TA技术架构咨询方法论</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8A8F99', marginLeft: 'auto' }}>25 / 30</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>